=\"definition\">adj. mentally or emotionally unsound or disturbed　扭曲的</p>\n        <p class=\"example\">She gave a small twisted smile.<span class=\"translation\">她不自然地微微一笑。</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-heading\">\n          <span class=\"number\">[2]</span>\n          <span class=\"term\">gem　　美 /dʒem/</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"definition\">n. (also gemstone) a precious stone that has been cut and<br>\n          polished and is used in jewellery（经切割打磨的）宝石</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry compact\">\n        <div class=\"entry-heading\">\n          <span class=\"number\">[3]</span>\n          <span class=\"term\">anthropologist　　美 /ˌænθrəˈpɑːlədʒɪst/　n. 人类学家</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-heading\">\n          <span class=\"number\">[4]</span>\n          <span class=\"term\"><span class=\"highlight-red\">date back to...</span> /deɪt frəm...　追溯到；始于；自……至今</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"example\">The college dates back to medieval times.</p>\n        <p class=\"translation-line\">这所学院创办于中世纪。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry commission\">\n        <div class=\"entry-heading\">\n          <span class=\"number\">[5]</span>\n          <span class=\"term\"><span class=\"highlight-yellow\">commission　　熟词僻义</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"definition\"><span class=\"definition-highlight\">v. to officially ask sb to write, make or create sth or to do a<br>\n          task for you　正式委托（谱写或制作、创作、完成）</span></p>\n        <p class=\"example\">Publishers have commissioned a French translation of the book.</p>\n        <p class=\"translation-line\">出版商已委托人把这本书译成法语。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry last-entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-heading\">\n          <span class=\"number\">[6]</span>\n          <span class=\"term\">accessory　　美 /əkˈsesəri/</span>\n        </div>\n      </d